:PATH
Section 1 Implementation
|

:INFO
Art. 60
1 OFCOM shall issue the necessary technical and administrative regulations.
2 It is entitled to conclude international agreements relating to technical or administrative issues that fall within the scope of this Ordinance.

:PATH
Section 2 Transitional Provision to the Amendment of 28 June 2023
|

:NOTE
Amended by No I of the O of 28 June 2023, in force since 1 Jan. 2024 (AS 2023 365).
|

:INFO
Art. 61
The Registry shall determine the date from which individuals may apply for and be allocated domain names under “.swiss” in accordance with Article 53 paragraph 1bis. Operations must begin by 1 May 2024 at the latest.
|

:NOTE
Art. 61 — Amended by No I of the O of 28 June 2023, in force since 1 Jan. 2024 (AS 2023 365).
|

:INFO
Art. 62–64
Repealed by No I of the O of 15 Sept. 2017, with effect from 1 Nov. 2017 (AS 2017 5225).

:PATH
Section 3 Commencement
|

:INFO
Art. 65
This Ordinance comes into force on 1 January 2015.

